Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《钻石星尘的反叛！另一个冰轮丸》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.17,0:01:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保卫工作做得怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:35.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告松本副队长 没有异常
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.57,0:01:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的工作很重要 别偷懒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过所说的“王印”到底是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.01,0:01:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,配备了这么多的警备 却还让我们掩人耳目地...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我是不懂什么权威啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:52.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那可是与王族息息相关的秘宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了王族以外是严禁被其他任何人看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未对外披露过的秘宝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:04.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的使用方法以及威力 都是我们不为所知的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是每隔数十年 就会像现在这样改变保管地点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迁移的力量 那就是“王印”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也不是知道的很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之这是我们十番队的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要加强警惕 严格监视
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是松本啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各处部署均无异常
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在近处看 更壮观了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为权威是需要一定装饰的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么连队长都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您要是这么说的话 会挨上头骂的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这些 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.51,0:03:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包围
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:45.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呻吟吧 灰猫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:04:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:01.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印被...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:16.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快阻止火势蔓延
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本副队长 十分对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让贼人逃脱了 我方多人受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.56,0:06:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在我家周围制造混乱嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这...这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你们是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐秘机动队
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我是死神代行 黑崎一护
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎一护 你在这里干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:31.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二番队队长兼隐秘机动队总司令官 碎蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该已经设好了结界的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.91,0:07:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.18,0:07:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:08:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本是没必要向你这个死神代行说明的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.06,0:08:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若发现贼人务必尽快报告
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石田 你怎么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天我就发现这一带附近布了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.36,0:08:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘雪了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是一直都隐藏着灵压吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵压？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.44,0:09:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.91,0:09:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周边已经全部搜索过了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但未能查出王印的去向
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只能将其考虑为袭击者带走了王印
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.11,0:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此外 护卫队负责人日番谷十番队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接到报告说找到了袭击者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:13.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就不着痕迹地隐藏了自己的灵压
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:14.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请不要说得日番谷队长像放弃职责一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.33,0:10:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他为什么采取了那样的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可是明显违反了法规
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.05,0:10:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:28.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我住口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命十番队全体队员禁闭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据情况 请做好废队的心理准备
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,废队？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您是说要废除十番队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队员们没有过错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如要要负责的话 就全由我这个副队长来承担
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本 注意你的措辞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的事态 你以为就区区一个副队长的性命就能揽下所有责任了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请搞清楚你的身份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要寻回王印 并在回收的同时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于这件事情的主要责任人十番队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷冬狮郎的搜寻 作为优先考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是紧急特令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.17,0:11:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在起 命令十番队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在队舎中暂时禁止外出
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且在找到日番谷十番队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及事件解决为止
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会有内贼存在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 全队没收斩魄刀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为...为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在怀疑我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道在事情解决之前 就让我们乖乖待在这里干等吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:11:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太专横了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好歹也给我们个表明清白的机会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是严令
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.81,0:12:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就冒犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么个情况了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不就是什么都没搞清楚吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是却...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:41.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可见被抢走的王印是多么地重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长一定会马上赶回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望吧 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么老是这么默不作声地就走了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长和市丸可不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩魄刀没收完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在将移至保管库收存
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 请各位不要轻举妄动 等候处分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要封闭队舍门了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本副队长请回自己房间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿散井副队长 到时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.87,0:13:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 我马上去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.21,0:13:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有件事 希望你们替我查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.87,0:13:38.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于队长追踪的那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:41.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那个人肯定和队长有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然队长怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是那个传闻的天才少年日番谷冬狮郎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要成为死神 为尸魂界而奋斗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎你好厉害啊 果然是个天才
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过下一次我绝对不会输的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎 我们永远都是朋友对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.99,0:14:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黒崎 这里是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能看着你昏倒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还放任不管啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:15:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那真是不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.99,0:15:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐秘机动队在到处找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就“嗯”字了事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛躲起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:21.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 算了随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要找回
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:32.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被盗的是王族的至宝“王印”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你这样的死神代行该管的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.41,0:15:47.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个小屁孩 真是太不可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.19,0:15:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 让我睡会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上我叫井上来 今天就先给我乖乖躺着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别偷偷摸摸的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去的时候光明正大地走不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.43,0:16:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛做得像心有愧疚一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:05.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这小子 干嘛要一个人走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事这么想不开
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那个叫“草冠”的有关吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:18.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击你 夺走王印的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个叫“草冠”的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.97,0:17:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是个被杀死的男人的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀死...被谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真啰嗦 难道就让我眼看着你被打个遍体鳞伤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:01.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么我通知隐秘机动队 要么你赶快回我家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二选一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把日番谷冬狮郎交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是敢妨碍我们的话 就消灭你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.26,0:18:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎 你到底想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:52.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月牙天冲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到竟然能挡开这一击
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个男人 到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.03,0:20:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作点 一护 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真丢人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来给他醒醒脑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.08,0:20:58.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快起来 臭一护 - 住手 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛 痛死了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 这样起得比较快吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 这么冷不防地揍人干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁让你老这么呆愣着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底昏了多久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎那小子跑哪儿去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.49,0:21:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说冬狮郎...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.85,0:21:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你见到日番谷队长了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候？哪儿见到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件披褂...是日番谷队长的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 你怎么不拦住他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然有拦 不过他还是走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是追两个来历不明的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看上去既像假面军团的又像破面的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.17,0:22:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那日番谷队长他怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.13,0:22:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...说是要抢回“王印”什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过并不仅仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.27,0:22:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像还...对了!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“草冠”是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.23,0:22:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是被杀死了的男人之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.27,0:22:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说那番话时的他...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次 你可以回一次尸魂界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我查一下叫“草冠”的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:49.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他和松本副队长所说的袭击者有什么关联
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:52.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题啦 但干嘛我要去...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我去 恐怕是见不了松本副队长的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.67,0:22:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.25,0:23:03.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真不是个美差啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.48,0:23:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要两个死神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.23,0:23:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要决定一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要挑出一个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的死神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选出正当的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我放弃冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得违抗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.63,0:23:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.32,0:23:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们 中央四十六室的决定要绝对地服从
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口 草冠是 草冠是我重要的...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.83,0:24:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷他怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他似乎真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有和护廷十三队取得联络
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他被找到之前 要把人带来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用 再观察一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要他的实力还与我相当
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这里就再也没有他的立足之地
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他只能服从于我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.76,0:24:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长进入真央灵术院
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.69,0:24:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在我被朽木家收养之后的事 所以不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.04,0:24:41.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说我们同是流魂街出身 但我是在“戌吊”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而日番谷队长则在“润林安”
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.24,0:24:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说五番队的雏森副队长和他像家人一样 一同长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:53.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么去问那个叫“雏森”的人就...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.62,0:24:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不巧的是 现在副队长她正在疗养中
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.40,0:25:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 根据我的判断 日番谷队长他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.37,0:25:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有和雏森副队长提过这么重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.43,0:25:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 如果是痛苦的回忆 那就更不用提了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.69,0:25:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是这么认为的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.85,0:25:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个坚强的人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.37,0:25:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 哪里坚强了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.51,0:25:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正坚强的人会让周围人这么难过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呆在这里继续想也不是个办法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.56,0:25:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会帮忙调查的 总之大家就
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.41,0:25:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去追查日番谷队长的行踪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:56.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.03,0:25:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禁止会见松本乱菊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.99,0:26:02.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系嘛 就说几句话而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.18,0:26:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.65,0:26:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是总队长以及二番队碎蜂队长的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.31,0:26:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 真是个死脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.26,0:26:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个大葱头
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:17.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.35,0:26:19.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你侮辱我了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.09,0:26:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说我是大葱头对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.78,0:26:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.38,0:26:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.25,0:26:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京乐队长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.41,0:26:34.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我陪他一起进去 这样总行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.79,0:26:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你不相信我这个八番队队长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.28,0:26:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.35,0:26:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不认识 从没听过这个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.94,0:26:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.59,0:26:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身为副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然一点都不了解队长
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:26:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先我们有几点想要弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.35,0:27:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:05.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和那个叫“草冠”的男人有些什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.94,0:27:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个男人到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.89,0:27:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他究竟和那起事件和何关联
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算有 那又是何种关系呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.11,0:27:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全一头雾水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.71,0:27:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调查清楚就行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.39,0:27:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查...查得出吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.06,0:27:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人想要知道他人的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.88,0:27:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.09,0:27:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点麻烦 不知道的话也就只有去查了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.78,0:27:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是很简单吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有...有什么问题吗 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是七绪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.52,0:27:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道七绪一定会想出办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.12,0:27:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.71,0:27:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.25,0:27:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.11,0:27:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七绪 谢谢你了 我会答谢你的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.30,0:27:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢礼的话 就用这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.21,0:27:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 请队长也务必来帮忙调查 这样没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.93,0:27:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 我也要查
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.76,0:27:57.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.71,0:28:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.30,0:28:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在现世的露琪亚和一护托我转交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.86,0:28:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据一护的话来说 还伤得不轻
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.47,0:28:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却把披褂扔下 消失得无影无踪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.52,0:28:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底应该庆幸他的平安
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是该气他平白无故地扔下这件披褂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.33,0:28:42.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.77,0:28:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害得大家都这么担心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.62,0:28:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.83,0:29:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾之名为冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.22,0:29:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼 你还妄想驾驭我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.91,0:29:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 冰轮丸 你要服从我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.37,0:29:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬獅郎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.99,0:29:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太偶然了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.10,0:29:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好开心啊 我们居然得到了相同的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.53,0:30:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我调查了一下近五十年的名册
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.50,0:30:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但没有查到名叫“草冠”的队员
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.31,0:30:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 有没有追溯过灵术院那边
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.08,0:30:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 但也没有类似的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是 日番谷队长毕业那年 名册上记载的人数
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和名字的个数不一致
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与记载不一的学生出身于北流魂街
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.22,0:30:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个区域的登录者名册中有叫“草冠”的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.49,0:30:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他 “草冠宗次郎”
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.13,0:31:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是“草冠”了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.73,0:31:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.04,0:31:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明没有记录在灵术院名册上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.34,0:31:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是单纯的漏写了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.14,0:31:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 事情恐怕没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.78,0:31:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是“死亡”的情况 就更别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.68,0:31:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 这样至少可以断定袭击者...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个叫“草冠宗次郎”的了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.85,0:31:26.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要还没有确认他的灵压消失了 就不可能记录为死亡的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.43,0:31:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正 他应该是死了吧 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.03,0:31:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出去散散步
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.97,0:31:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七绪你去查一下死亡名册
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.99,0:31:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.73,0:32:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎哟哟 到底是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不说 不是会让人更好奇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.28,0:32:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京乐春水
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与那轻薄的举动所不同的深思熟虑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.03,0:32:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有着胜于他人的敏锐的慧眼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你是第一个察觉到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.39,0:32:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受到夸奖我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.35,0:32:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过比起揣摩他人 你坦白一下自己的事怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.64,0:32:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没这个必要
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.11,0:32:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你会在这里被日番谷冬狮郎给杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.26,0:33:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的斩魄刀是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.13,0:33:10.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看你的真面目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.64,0:33:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.13,0:33:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长 这是紧急特令
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.36,0:33:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请即刻返回瀞灵廷
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.37,0:33:52.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕难从命
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.05,0:34:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请住手 这样会被视为谋反的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.02,0:34:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下 吉良 桧佐木
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.99,0:34:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长 我们要拘捕你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.51,0:34:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:24.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缚道之六十二 百步栏干
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您束手就擒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.51,0:35:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,端坐霜天 冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.63,0:35:25.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好净气结界的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.67,0:35:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上进行术式
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.27,0:35:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.91,0:35:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浮竹队长
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.72,0:35:43.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京乐会被人袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.55,0:35:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为对方要么出其不意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.29,0:35:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要么实力在他之上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.49,0:35:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.63,0:35:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.76,0:35:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再说一遍 这不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.00,0:36:02.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在六番队正在勘察现场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.94,0:36:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就能抓住刺客的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.26,0:36:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 就是冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.53,0:36:30.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你说是冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.73,0:36:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长他...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.10,0:36:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来这边也情况不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告 三番队 吉良伊鹤以及
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.61,0:36:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九番队 桧佐木修兵代理队长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.75,0:36:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在现世遭遇日番谷冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.25,0:36:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于遭受了抵抗 都负伤而归
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.68,0:37:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被反挫了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.14,0:37:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说冬狮郎攻击了队友
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.38,0:37:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.88,0:37:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像连京乐队长也被袭击了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.89,0:37:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京乐队长
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.15,0:37:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据恋次说
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.76,0:37:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被冰轮丸所伤 且双方都身负重伤
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.53,0:37:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石田 你能用灵压追踪下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.03,0:37:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说小菜一碟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.63,0:37:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.77,0:37:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 又回到起点了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.54,0:37:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...各位 不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.78,0:37:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家先各自回去 下午再重新出发
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.99,0:37:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.95,0:38:00.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 我还...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.62,0:38:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别勉强了 就那么办吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算着急 也未必马上就能找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.20,0:38:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷冬狮郎有谋反的嫌疑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.14,0:38:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特此将紧急特令变更为护廷大命
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.16,0:38:22.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我冒昧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.28,0:38:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的决定是否有些操之过急了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.55,0:38:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准有异议
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续搜索王印
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.18,0:38:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并以逮捕日番谷冬狮郎为最优先考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.86,0:38:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如有任何抵抗行为的话
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.93,0:38:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当场处决
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.58,0:38:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 恋次有消息 瀞灵廷发布护廷大命了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.71,0:38:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.34,0:39:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是发布了对日番谷队长的处刑命令
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.32,0:39:05.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处刑命令是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.62,0:39:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕已经没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.42,0:39:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说没有任何商量的余地了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.59,0:39:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.26,0:39:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 还有个消息 就是查出谁是“草冠”了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.85,0:39:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.28,0:39:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“草冠宗次郎”是日番谷队长以前的同学
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.97,0:39:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就死在
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.21,0:39:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长从真央灵术院毕业前
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.65,0:39:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这帮混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.82,0:39:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该警告过你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.09,0:39:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆敢阻拦的话杀无赦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.99,0:39:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.99,0:39:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.96,0:39:51.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 那个男人可不一般
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.53,0:39:53.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的灵压非同寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.86,0:40:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.21,0:40:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下正好你我处于相反的位子了呢 京乐
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前总是我躺在病床上被你探望呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.73,0:40:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.43,0:40:26.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一点我始终觉得有疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.07,0:40:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依据调查而明确的冰轮丸的犯罪时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与搜查队遇到日番谷的时间...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.61,0:40:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再怎么快马加鞭地赶去现世
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.88,0:40:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是要花相当长的时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.88,0:40:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果假设二者都是冰轮丸的所为
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.36,0:40:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,端坐霜天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.73,0:40:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.67,0:41:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你这混蛋会...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.03,0:41:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是冰轮丸的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.35,0:41:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.72,0:41:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以说是把双子斩魄刀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.52,0:41:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩魄刀是从死神自身的灵魂中诞生的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.76,0:41:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓始解
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.23,0:41:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是斩魄刀和死神一对一进行的契约一样的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.43,0:41:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以是不可能与多个死神缔结契约的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.13,0:41:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的话 就称不上是斩魄刀了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.17,0:41:41.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么有没有办法证明多重契约是不可能的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.14,0:41:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明“冰轮丸”不可能存在两把...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.38,0:41:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“冰轮丸”
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.45,0:41:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假设存在两把的话 那其中的一个主人就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.56,0:41:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.25,0:41:55.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总算明白你们为什么要来找我了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.69,0:41:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜入大灵书回廊的内院这等蒜皮大的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.93,0:42:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于我来说简直轻而易举嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.45,0:42:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.55,0:42:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫草冠宗次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.32,0:42:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.56,0:42:34.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被瀞灵廷 中央四十六室
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.13,0:42:37.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被日番谷冬狮郎杀害了的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.97,0:42:45.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尸魂界已经
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.51,0:42:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,视日番谷冬狮郎为叛逆者
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.47,0:42:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经可以回去的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.79,0:42:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的不确定要素只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.15,0:42:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你受死吧 死神
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.13,0:43:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.27,0:43:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠 为什么你...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.60,0:43:21.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始宣布四十六室的决议
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.29,0:43:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一把斩魄刀 绝不允许有两个主人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.35,0:43:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 要在二位之间
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.05,0:43:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举行生死决斗 来确定主人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.66,0:43:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说要我们自相残杀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.19,0:43:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正统的资质
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.23,0:43:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相应的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.06,0:43:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸就是拥有这么的不寻常力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.90,0:43:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它作为一种荣耀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.74,0:43:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.90,0:43:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要和草冠决斗的话 我宁可放弃冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.77,0:43:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不成
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.87,0:43:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.68,0:43:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:43:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不能持有相同的斩魄刀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.85,0:44:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不容许改变
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.55,0:44:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是远古以来的铁规则
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.24,0:44:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得违背
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.95,0:44:06.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他给流放了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.05,0:44:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.39,0:44:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一决生死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.63,0:44:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.27,0:44:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.28,0:44:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是什么人 想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.81,0:44:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸的持有者确定为日番谷冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.62,0:44:40.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有分出胜负呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.25,0:44:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸是属于我的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.62,0:44:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是四十六室的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.89,0:44:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 再让我...唔...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.69,0:44:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.97,0:45:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要死...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.07,0:45:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.35,0:45:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为了 尸魂界...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.75,0:45:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.01,0:45:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷要和我同进退 绝不让你们妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.88,0:45:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.76,0:45:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.47,0:46:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸的威力又长进了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.01,0:46:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了 剩下的就交给你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.98,0:46:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.82,0:46:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破道之三十三 苍火坠
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.95,0:46:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩月
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.97,0:46:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见了 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.74,0:46:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的那个是什么 幻影吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.14,0:46:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是共鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.91,0:46:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩魄刀产生共鸣震动 让我们看到过去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.98,0:46:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.02,0:46:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是无可厚非的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.89,0:46:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尸魂界厌恶两把冰轮丸的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.76,0:47:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而杀了其中的一个 到底为什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.53,0:47:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是老规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.56,0:47:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在尸魂界中胜于一切的铁规则
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.80,0:47:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是世界的存续和平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.14,0:47:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些家伙们 把人的意愿当作什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.51,0:47:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的话可真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.21,0:47:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于我们来说 人的意愿什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.75,0:47:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不值得和世界拿来做比较 是不足取的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.65,0:47:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的世界不是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.86,0:47:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但人的心却因此动摇 紊乱
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.25,0:47:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遁入邪道也是不可避免的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.29,0:47:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.54,0:47:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.67,0:47:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎他从没那么想过
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.33,0:47:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.73,0:47:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.48,0:47:53.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过去 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.25,0:47:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的我 和他有着相同的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.45,0:48:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我妈死后的一段时间里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.06,0:48:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各种感情蜂涌而出 简直难以自拔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.69,0:48:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 背负起一切
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.73,0:48:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为一个人承担是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.31,0:48:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没有察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.42,0:48:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围人正为了这样的自己而悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.29,0:48:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎和那时候的我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.33,0:48:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要一个人背负一切
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.46,0:48:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.14,0:48:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.64,0:48:52.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他究竟想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.84,0:48:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.81,0:48:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然察觉到了就别再动摇了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.91,0:49:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.53,0:49:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.10,0:49:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.17,0:49:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.30,0:49:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 草冠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.58,0:49:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 让他逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.28,0:49:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就赶快把这两个家伙给解决了 再追上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.78,0:49:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.60,0:49:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.59,0:49:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受到草冠大人的攻击 居然还能活命
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.49,0:49:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个麻烦的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.49,0:49:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定得打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.70,0:49:50.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.44,0:49:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些话无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.34,0:50:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都要告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.84,0:50:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终于找来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.41,0:50:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都等着你来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.62,0:50:45.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.99,0:50:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为此 还特意用冰轮丸伤了你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.86,0:50:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我还活着的事 这么难以置信吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.19,0:50:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.44,0:50:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.41,0:51:02.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们绕了个大圈子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.64,0:51:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大圈子？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.82,0:51:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 你应该知道得最清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.47,0:51:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护廷十三队是个怎样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.81,0:51:15.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便那样 你到底为了什么而留在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.98,0:51:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了那个天真无邪的青梅竹马？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.55,0:51:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不关雏森的事 王印在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.56,0:51:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 在我这啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.03,0:51:30.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用它来实现我们的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.83,0:51:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.07,0:51:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印有什么力量
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.20,0:51:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.11,0:51:43.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么慌张嘛 你马上就会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.88,0:51:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 我们一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.66,0:51:56.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.82,0:52:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.76,0:52:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 但这绝非寻常的灵压
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.63,0:52:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是更加纯粹而强大的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.07,0:52:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.34,0:52:15.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是 那就是王印的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.34,0:52:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.98,0:52:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠大人和日番谷冬狮郎联手 向瀞灵廷发起的复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.38,0:52:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 瀞灵廷
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.65,0:52:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个家伙太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.05,0:52:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有不管怎样都一定要让你死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.49,0:52:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝不让任何人阻挠草冠大人的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.63,0:52:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.47,0:52:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚 给我上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.18,0:52:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.02,0:52:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在双殛之丘出现了类似王印的灵压
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.66,0:53:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.82,0:53:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你们都给我回房间去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.63,0:53:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 诶? 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.83,0:53:13.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.20,0:53:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧急传令
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.50,0:53:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告知在现世及尸魂界内执行搜查的全体队员
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.81,0:53:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在双殛之丘 发现了日番谷十番队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.21,0:53:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和疑似王印抢夺者的灵压
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.45,0:53:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请全体队员立刻返回 采取紧急防卫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.92,0:53:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复 请立刻返回 采取紧急防卫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.69,0:53:38.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然这么轻易地就让对方入侵了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.06,0:53:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人知道十三队警备薄弱之处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.10,0:53:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.17,0:53:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.48,0:54:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.12,0:54:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 是双殛之丘
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.02,0:54:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是王印的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.52,0:54:14.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印可依据使用者的意志 不受空间和时间的约束
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.73,0:54:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可将一切事物移动到别的次元中去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.40,0:54:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 只要使用王印的力量 别说是刚才的移动了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.74,0:54:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是将敌人的攻击移动到别的次元中去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是把致命伤治愈 都是可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.78,0:54:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠 这么说来 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.85,0:54:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我那就快灰飞烟灭的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.18,0:54:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在偶然的机遇下受到了王印之光的照耀 被转移到了虚圈才得以重生
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.49,0:54:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我自那以后便一直寻觅着王印的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.76,0:54:51.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了向瀞灵廷复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.93,0:54:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.97,0:55:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它劈开 以你的卍解这不是什么难事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.81,0:55:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劈开王印？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.31,0:55:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 只有这样才能净化一切
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.29,0:55:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们抢了头马啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.93,0:55:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 一角
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.73,0:55:26.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长 这是为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.10,0:55:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 再说什么都是枉然
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.97,0:55:35.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奉紧急特令及护廷大命
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.97,0:55:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕日番谷冬狮郎和王印抢夺者
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.68,0:55:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斑目一角
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.78,0:55:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有超群的体力和剑术
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.58,0:55:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护廷十三队中屈指可数的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.95,0:55:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夸我也没什么好处
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.96,0:55:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不是我的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.19,0:55:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.70,0:56:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受了这么重的伤还... 你是玩真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.47,0:56:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛这么执着啊 日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.51,0:56:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.78,0:56:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数量太夸张了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.09,0:56:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.59,0:56:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说好有什么事要通知我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚都...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.94,0:56:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.90,0:56:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的银岭弧雀 连射可以达到一千二百呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.98,0:56:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就凭你们这么弱的虚 召唤多少都没用
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 黑崎同学
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.88,0:56:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石田 你这家伙打中我们怎办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.78,0:56:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才没那么笨手笨脚 话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.85,0:56:55.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.79,0:56:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.19,0:57:02.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石田 这个家伙就由我来...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.74,0:57:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨人的手腕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.38,0:57:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就趁现在 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.48,0:57:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快去尸魂界
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.31,0:57:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浦原先生已经在准备穿界门了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.62,0:57:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们就交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.85,0:57:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救冬狮郎去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.16,0:57:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们...我们走 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.16,0:57:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 井上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.60,0:57:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.65,0:57:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.98,0:57:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投降吧 日番谷
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.72,0:58:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有后面的那位
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.02,0:58:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可笑了 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.73,0:58:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.56,0:58:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.23,0:58:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就让那些蠢蛋们见识一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.14,0:58:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的仇恨 我们的痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.04,0:58:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的复仇 快劈了它 冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.18,0:58:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.42,0:58:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月牙天冲
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.60,0:58:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.70,0:58:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.84,0:58:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就只会战斗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.68,0:59:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听过冬狮郎的解释了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.45,0:59:06.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别因为是命令什么的 就简单地去拼命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.82,0:59:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 死神代行算个什么 这是护廷大命
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.39,0:59:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于我们来说 执行上级命令才是应该死守的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.06,0:59:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是说那个规定不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.46,0:59:19.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多说无益
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.97,0:59:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是再敢反抗 连你也一块斩了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.94,0:59:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.45,0:59:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山本元柳斋重国总队长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.36,0:59:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京乐 你醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.60,0:59:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.27,0:59:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是无辜的人被处罚的话 可是会做噩梦的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.74,1:00:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着啊 草冠宗次郎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.01,1:00:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该已经被杀死了的 对吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.29,1:00:16.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印赋予了你生命
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.99,1:00:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而虚圈又重新培育了你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.56,1:00:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 所以我又回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.06,1:00:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠王印获得重生
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.31,1:00:31.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且掌握王印 成为尸魂界的王者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.30,1:00:35.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说尸魂界的王者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.57,1:00:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大言不惭
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.02,1:00:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 事到如今 你们这些家伙才高傲自大呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:44.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让你们见识见识
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.23,1:00:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.19,1:00:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.30,1:00:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过来 松本
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.36,1:01:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.60,1:01:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.97,1:01:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从头到尾都没打算跟你一伙
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.14,1:01:15.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来他并不是要背叛护廷十三队
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为何与我们刀锋相向
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.45,1:01:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要斩杀我吗 你又想杀我一次吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.79,1:01:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在赎自己的罪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.73,1:01:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有何罪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.73,1:01:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为杀了我就能赎罪了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.15,1:01:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 草冠他原本是
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.68,1:01:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发誓效忠尸魂界的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.04,1:01:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但由于斩魄刀不允许存在相同的两把这个原因
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.08,1:01:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说是得到声名了 反而
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.37,1:01:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被尸魂界所肃清
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.47,1:01:56.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 他以为所有错都在于自己
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.26,1:01:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长他没能再次
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.09,1:02:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在护廷十三队的立场上 斩杀对方
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.76,1:02:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.70,1:02:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 对于生还的草冠
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.63,1:02:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他舍弃了护廷十三队队长之位
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.07,1:02:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要一个人做了断
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.14,1:02:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算会因此落到被处决的下场也在所不惜
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.16,1:02:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从一开始就...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.82,1:02:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.62,1:02:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 原来我看错你了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就由我一个人来完成
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.53,1:02:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印 回应我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.03,1:02:43.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.84,1:02:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不能用卍解的力量解放王印
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.88,1:02:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如今的我...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.31,1:03:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.50,1:03:11.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别一个人硬撑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.01,1:03:13.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪开 黑崎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要一个人妄想背负全部
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.93,1:03:19.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的痛苦和觉悟
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.34,1:03:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也让你的同伴们分担啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.15,1:03:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不是队长了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.71,1:03:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人钻牛角尖
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.17,1:03:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道周围人为此承受多少痛苦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.82,1:03:35.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这点你想过没有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.79,1:03:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一样的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.40,1:03:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想依赖他人的心情 我很理解
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.89,1:03:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.94,1:03:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.11,1:03:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游子 夏梨 干嘛这么慌张啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.95,1:04:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一哥 为什么要勉强自己笑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.15,1:04:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说为什么...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.03,1:04:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 能让我们一起分担你的感受吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.20,1:04:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是一家人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.77,1:04:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开心也好 悲伤也罢 都不要一个人硬撑
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.51,1:04:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的话 我们会很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.92,1:04:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是到头来 最软弱的却是你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.37,1:04:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.84,1:04:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.11,1:05:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.45,1:05:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.52,1:05:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好 黑崎 他要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.27,1:05:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我终于得到王印的力量了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.22,1:05:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剑八
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.28,1:06:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 就这么结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.74,1:06:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来挺强的 还不是...嗯?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.34,1:06:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.45,1:06:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的攻击对我没用
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.42,1:06:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没死绝啊 有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.10,1:06:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.94,1:06:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.31,1:06:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真碍事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.35,1:07:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了 这力量太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.46,1:07:33.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.69,1:07:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是草冠的...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.70,1:07:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 搞得这么狼狈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.40,1:07:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会又是当逃兵了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.20,1:07:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.40,1:07:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也罢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.34,1:07:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杨
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.05,1:07:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他还要进化吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.78,1:08:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别慌
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.95,1:08:31.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得退缩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.78,1:08:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩杀 重罪犯草冠宗次郎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.63,1:08:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.70,1:08:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.14,1:08:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.75,1:08:59.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散落吧 千本樱
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.00,1:09:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.03,1:09:24.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.75,1:09:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.02,1:09:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.46,1:09:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王印的力量已经完全解放了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.46,1:09:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 这是王印的暴走
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.26,1:09:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.90,1:09:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 灵压渐渐增强开始扩散了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.20,1:09:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么下去瀞灵廷会被吞噬的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.80,1:10:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会有灭顶之危
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.67,1:10:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灭顶之危！？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.28,1:10:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那灵压的确很强大 不过那也太...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓王印 是能通过解放
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.62,1:10:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来操纵限定场所的时间 空间 次元
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.79,1:10:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中的所有事物的神器
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.49,1:10:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说 在限定的场所中
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.19,1:10:25.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够获得等同于神的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.40,1:10:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消去和再生 简直轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.24,1:10:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 没有领悟卍解的草冠的剑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.67,1:10:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无法驾驭王印的 总而言之...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.44,1:10:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是最糟糕的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.80,1:11:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:04.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.64,1:11:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.84,1:11:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在背后保护队长 是我作为副队长的使命
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.30,1:11:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛痛痛 露琪亚你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.29,1:11:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.13,1:11:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 冬狮郎 你们也都平安啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.16,1:11:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 一护
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.43,1:11:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 恋次
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.00,1:11:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么怎么了 好好看看周围吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.43,1:11:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.67,1:11:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简单说来就是草冠的城堡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.11,1:11:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我们都被关在了灵壁之中
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.88,1:11:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么做...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.18,1:11:50.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.18,1:11:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.19,1:11:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜一
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.09,1:11:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须分秒必争了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.49,1:12:01.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总队长正抑制着这个空间的膨胀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.56,1:12:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命我们抓紧时间斩杀草冠
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.13,1:12:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 怎么斩杀啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.73,1:12:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从底下往上爬啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.17,1:12:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后摧毁中心处的塔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.24,1:12:19.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 就趁他现在停止着的空隙
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.01,1:12:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.91,1:12:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我来也
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.45,1:12:25.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得的盛典啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.38,1:12:28.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算上我一个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.99,1:12:30.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 还有我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.39,1:12:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.63,1:12:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是虚!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.53,1:12:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管了 这里就交给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.97,1:12:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜一
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.24,1:12:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎蜂 我们上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.71,1:12:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬开
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.83,1:13:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目标是上面
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.50,1:13:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.07,1:13:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.22,1:13:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.29,1:13:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.52,1:13:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背后就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.66,1:13:40.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.87,1:13:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们分两路走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.57,1:13:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 恋次 露琪亚 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.10,1:13:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又和你们一组啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.11,1:13:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.37,1:14:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？ 是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.22,1:14:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个女的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.22,1:14:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.38,1:14:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.00,1:14:19.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.20,1:14:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.91,1:14:31.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狒狒王 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.28,1:14:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一层层跑也不是个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.25,1:14:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踩着蛇尾丸朝上面去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.85,1:14:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.53,1:14:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.66,1:15:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎蜂 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.62,1:15:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.60,1:15:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽敌蛰杀 雀蜂
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.33,1:15:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二击决杀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.67,1:15:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.92,1:15:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然超速再生
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.03,1:15:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.74,1:16:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个怪物居然还会动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.94,1:16:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.48,1:16:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这股灵压...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.02,1:16:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.36,1:16:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.83,1:16:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碍事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.96,1:16:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快往上赶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.28,1:16:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.10,1:17:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙连大虚也能操纵吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.07,1:17:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灰猫
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.99,1:17:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就差一点了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.56,1:17:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得想办法 突破这里
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.87,1:17:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凌舞吧 袖白雪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.90,1:17:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,次之舞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.71,1:17:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白涟
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.54,1:18:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.64,1:18:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.91,1:18:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 看见那座塔了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.54,1:18:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里到那边 哪怕是一瞬间只要能开出条路的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.95,1:18:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有把握以天锁斩月的速度 一口气冲到顶吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.83,1:18:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.19,1:18:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别无他法了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.95,1:18:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和一角 弓亲 三人合力的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.11,1:18:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以在一瞬间冲出条路来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.96,1:18:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.96,1:18:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我同意
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.00,1:18:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 松本
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.46,1:18:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 开路的话大爷我一个人就够了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.30,1:18:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要干了吗 一角
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.74,1:18:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷队长 松本
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.71,1:18:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要替我保密啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.41,1:19:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.06,1:19:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙纹鬼灯丸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.68,1:19:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初之舞 月白
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.43,1:19:51.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.10,1:19:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.15,1:19:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.42,1:20:12.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别粗心大意
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.98,1:20:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白哉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.78,1:20:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总队长他们在外面承受着重担
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.46,1:20:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎一护 快去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.57,1:20:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.37,1:20:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歼景 千本樱景严
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.25,1:20:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狒骨大砲
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.70,1:21:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大红莲冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.73,1:22:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月牙天冲
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.31,1:22:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.84,1:22:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了啊 一护
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.13,1:23:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.65,1:23:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.15,1:23:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做个决断吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.75,1:23:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.61,1:23:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要两个死神
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.36,1:24:01.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须选一个
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.58,1:24:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不成
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.19,1:24:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.87,1:24:08.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一决生死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.79,1:24:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日番谷
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.58,1:24:12.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.59,1:24:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠 我...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.85,1:24:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然...是个天才
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.06,1:24:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你杀了我两次
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.13,1:24:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我是不会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.10,1:24:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我的存在...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.21,1:25:02.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草冠
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.54,1:25:08.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们永远...都是朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.12,1:25:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 如果我...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.52,1:25:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果...吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.03,1:25:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来结束了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.24,1:25:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.45,1:25:44.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.22,1:25:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你猜哪边赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.15,1:25:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真傻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.26,1:25:52.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个问题...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.15,1:26:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么个小东西...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.03,1:26:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 黑崎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.30,1:26:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想那家伙 一定没感到后悔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.27,1:26:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在最后能和你分出高下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.61,1:26:49.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生在世
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.21,1:26:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都会有想不开的事
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.28,1:26:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 是否认同 都是由自己来决定的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.62,1:27:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生还后的他 凭借自己的意志来到了这里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.70,1:27:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没有人强求他
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.46,1:27:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是为了替自己做个了断
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.34,1:27:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 这样不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.51,1:27:18.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然搞得这里一片狼籍
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.98,1:27:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回去吧 冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.60,1:27:37.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别叫我冬狮郎 叫我日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.21,1:27:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.32,1:31:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.82,1:32:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.50,1:32:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很对不起 谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.58,1:32:07.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？ 队长你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.19,1:32:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没说 回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.26,1:32:12.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？ 现在回去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.81,1:32:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就先不要再管工作了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.86,1:32:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那个 在这附近有个很好的温泉哦
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.58,1:32:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去你自己去
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.75,1:32:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这么无情啦 我们去嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.05,1:32:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 别扯我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.12,1:28:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即便解开扣错的纽扣 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.32,1:28:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我们也不会有任何改变吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.52,1:28:16.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我们可不是一直在这里光做着梦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.69,1:28:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 而不努力的蠢人 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.95,1:28:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 之前止失去的东西和 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.78,1:28:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 此后你将见到的东西 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.94,1:28:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 全部交换一下的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.62,1:28:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那会不会有所改变呢 会有所改变吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.59,1:28:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 至今你所为之哭泣过的事 全都用腼腆的话语讲出来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 心中那漆黑的阴影 全部会被赶走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.97,1:28:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 想要舍弃过去的自己 想要拥抱你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.88,1:29:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 欲望都从我的静脉中流淌出 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.79,1:29:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 即便光在沙漠中做着梦 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.96,1:29:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 也是看穿不了他们的滑头的吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.27,1:29:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我们一直在这里流着眼泪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.31,1:29:35.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但没有软弱到只会责备自己 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.47,1:29:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 之前你所听过的东西 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.52,1:29:46.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 回忆中的那首歌 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.79,1:29:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果一直唱到天亮的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.46,1:29:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那是不是就能够原谅呢 能够原谅吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.43,1:30:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 现在开始我要歌唱 融化你那憔悴的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.31,1:30:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 那些漆黑的一个人颤抖着的夜晚 全部会被赶走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.01,1:30:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我们的夜晚不再纯净 那就不能再相信任何人了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.75,1:30:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 欲望打破这寂静流露出来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.93,1:30:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 少男少女们 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.64,1:30:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 青春大爆走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.45,1:30:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让我的头脑中充满你的存在吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.28,1:30:43.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 至今你所为之哭泣过的事 全都用腼腆的话语讲出来吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.11,1:30:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 心中那漆黑的阴影 全都变为雪白 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.82,1:30:54.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就算终有一天会死 我也绝不想将你忘却 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.59,1:31:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 欲望使得我的静脉变得片片零落 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.80,1:31:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 片片零落 挥洒泪水 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.58,1:31:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 跳舞到早晨 继续我的恋爱 ∮
